nsfer learning VGG, we achieve 73.74% average pixel accuracy and 58.45% average IoU on the test set. In addition, we achieve 78.03% average test pixel accuracy and 64.04% average test IoU by the method of U-Net. Finally, we build a new model named Mobile-Deeplabv3+, and we achieved 83.56% average pixel accuracy and 71.35% average IoU on the test set.","topics":[],"score":288508,"global_rank":28279,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5921},{"name":"FredHutch/nextflow-aws-batch-squared","owner":"FredHutch","html_url":"https://github.com/FredHutch/nextflow-aws-batch-squared","stars":10,"forks":3,"watchers":8,"issues":4,"language":"Python","description":"Run Nextflow on AWS Batch (Squared)","topics":[],"score":288485,"global_rank":28291,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5922},{"name":"vlandeiro/yamlett","owner":"vlandeiro","html_url":"https://github.com/vlandeiro/yamlett","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Yet Another ML Experiment Tracking Tool","topics":[],"score":288477,"global_rank":28294,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5923},{"name":"spyoungtech/certbot-route53-hook","owner":"spyoungtech","html_url":"https://github.com/spyoungtech/certbot-route53-hook","stars":5,"forks":3,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Cerbot manual auth hook for satisfying dns challenges via AWS Route 53 / boto3","topics":[],"score":288468,"global_rank":28301,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5924},{"name":"evidenceinthewild/zetyra-validation","owner":"evidenceinthewild","html_url":"https://github.com/evidenceinthewild/zetyra-validation","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"896 tests / 42 scripts validating Zetyra calculators (GSD, CUPED, Bayesian, SSR incl. Single-Arm, RAR, Master Protocol). Replicates 8 published trials (Salk, DAPA-HF, PACIFIC, MONALEESA-7, I-SPY 2, STAMPEDE, REMAP-CAP, NCT03377023) + Leyrat 2024.","topics":["adapti